#. <CLT 4>モノクマが写るモニター…
#. 今は校章が浮かんでいるだけだ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0001 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>This is one of the monitors Monokuma appears on.\n"
"Right now, it's just showing the school crest.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. これも、壊したら…罰があるのかもな…
msgctxt "0002 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "If I break it...Monokuma might come and punish *me*."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>こんなカメラで…人が死ぬところも見てるのか…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0003 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Someone's using these cameras to watch people die...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>ムカツクけど、無視するしかない…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0004 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>It's infuriating...but I have to just try and not\n"
"think about it.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>ＤＶＤデッキだ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0005 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>It's the DVD player.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>また…あの変な映像の事を思い出しちゃう…
#. ここには長居したくないな…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0006 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I don't want to stay here too long. The less I have to\n"
"think about that creepy video, the better...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>もう何も入ってない…
#. あの…妙なねつ造の映像のＤＶＤも…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0007 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>There's nothing in here anymore. I can't help but\n"
"think about that creepy DVD...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. はい
msgctxt "0008 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "Yes"
msgstr ""

#. いいえ
msgctxt "0009 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "No"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 23>外に出ますか？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0010 | NARRATION"
msgid ""
"<CLT 23>Leave the area?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""
